  "observable_outcome": "The complete official 2026 Week 1 national contest universe is captured and bound. Ninety-one Division I contests were enumerated across the five declared dates from the official NCAA route, reached directly first and through a transport to the same official uniform resource identifier when the direct route was blocked. Every contest binds its official contest identifier, ordered away and home participants, a conservative kickoff lower bound, its published site annotation, and exactly one disposition. All one hundred eighty-two participants carry official 2026-27 subdivision and conference authority taken from the official institution lists rather than from a historical row; one hundred seventy-four carry a canonical identity established by the predecessor entity benchmark and eight remain truthfully unresolved, so their eight contests are UNSUPPORTED_ENTITY rather than silently dropped. No venue identity is claimed because the official route publishes none, and no forecast, model, or outcome field was produced.",
